>   4.	New character type: A Ghostbuster. We've recently got very tired
>	of meeting learner players ghosts all over levels 2-4.

If you want to be a Ghostburster, find the ghosts (as any character) and
do one of the following:
1. Kill them.
2. Escape.
3. Quit.
4. Die on another level.
The ghost(s) you found will be gone, but of course in case 4. you may have
added another ghost. Note that in some hack versions ghosts will follow you
up- or down-stairs.


